YouTube = smart, 🇯🇵日本, 🇸🇬新加坡, include-other-group=✈️ 我的节点, policy-regex-filter=(🇭🇰|🇺🇸|🇯🇵|🇨🇳|🇰🇷|🇸🇬|香港|美国|日本|台湾|韩国|新加坡|Hong|States|Japan|Tai|Korea|Singapore|HK|US|JP|TW|KR|SG), icon-url=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Rabbit-Spec/Surge/Master/Conf/icon/YouTube.png, no-alert=0, hidden=0, include-all-proxies=0
Spotify = select, PROXY, "🇭🇰 香港节点", "🇺🇸 美国节点", "🇯🇵 日本节点", "🇰🇷 韩国节点", "🇸🇬 新加坡节点", icon-url=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Rabbit-Spec/Surge/Master/Conf/icon/Spotify.png
TikTok = select, "🇭🇰 香港节点", "🇺🇸 美国节点", "🇯🇵 日本节点", "🇰🇷 韩国节点", "🇸🇬 新加坡节点", icon-url=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Rabbit-Spec/Surge/Master/Conf/icon/TikTok.png, no-alert=0, hidden=0, include-all-proxies=0
BiliBili = select, DIRECT, "🇭🇰 香港节点", "🇨🇳 台湾节点", icon-url=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Rabbit-Spec/Surge/Master/Conf/icon/Bilibili.png
