# > 微软服务
Microsoft = select, DIRECT, PROXY, "🇭🇰 香港节点", "🇺🇸 美国节点", "🇯🇵 日本节点", "🇰🇷 韩国节点", "🇸🇬 新加坡节点", icon-url=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Rabbit-Spec/Surge/Master/Conf/icon/Windows.png

# > 游戏平台
Game = select, DIRECT, PROXY, "🇭🇰 香港节点", "🇺🇸 美国节点", "🇯🇵 日本节点", "🇰🇷 韩国节点", "🇸🇬 新加坡节点", icon-url=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Rabbit-Spec/Surge/Master/Conf/icon/Game.png, no-alert=0, hidden=0

# > 地区策略组（从订阅中按正则筛选）
🇭🇰 香港节点 = smart, include-other-group=✈️ 我的节点, policy-regex-filter=(🇭🇰)|(香港)|(Hong)|(HK), icon-url=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Rabbit-Spec/Surge/Master/Conf/icon/Country-Hong_Kong.png
🇺🇸 美国节点 = smart, include-other-group=✈️ 我的节点, policy-regex-filter=(🇺🇸)|(美国)|(States)|(US), icon-url=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Rabbit-Spec/Surge/Master/Conf/icon/Country-United_States.png
🇯🇵 日本节点 = smart, include-other-group=✈️ 我的节点, policy-regex-filter=(🇯🇵)|(日本)|(Japan)|(JP), icon-url=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Rabbit-Spec/Surge/Master/Conf/icon/Country-Japan.png
🇨🇳 台湾节点 = smart, include-other-group=✈️ 我的节点, policy-regex-filter=(🇨🇳)|(台湾)|(Tai)|(TW), icon-url=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Rabbit-Spec/Surge/Master/Conf/icon/Country-China.png, hidden=1
🇰🇷 韩国节点 = smart, include-other-group=✈️ 我的节点, policy-regex-filter=(🇰🇷)|(韩国)|(Korea)|(\bKR), icon-url=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Rabbit-Spec/Surge/Master/Conf/icon/Country-South_Korea.png, hidden=1
🇸🇬 新加坡节点 = smart, include-other-group=✈️ 我的节点, policy-regex-filter=(🇸🇬)|(新加坡)|(Singapore)|(SG), icon-url=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Rabbit-Spec/Surge/Master/Conf/icon/Country-Singapore.png

# > 订阅源
✈️ 我的节点 = smart, policy-path=https://sub.store/download/collection/ZDY?target=Surge, update-interval=0, no-alert=1, hidden=0, icon-url=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Rabbit-Spec/Surge/Master/Conf/icon/Proxy.png, include-all-proxies=0
